code .gitignore
```

Paste this in exactly, then **Ctrl+S** to save:
```
# SECRETS — never push these
.env
.env.local
*.key
secrets.json

# LOCAL DATA — stays on your machine
output/
config/agent.db
config/brand_kit/
scripts/generated/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# PyInstaller
*.spec